WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,450
What are we doing up so early?

2
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:02,650
Sleep with me for another half hour

3
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:04,050
There's a lot going on today

4
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,850
The 30 sets of staff dormitories you asked me to buy in full yesterday

5
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,050
Today I have to order furniture to make a wardrobe.

6
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:12,650
And I also want to move into the staff dormitory as soon as possible

7
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,650
Is it uncomfortable to live in eighteen large villas?

8
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,450
What are you going to do when you move out, boss?

9
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,050
I am your full-time secretary

10
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:19,850
Living with you in Louwang every day

11
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:22,850
New employees of the company will gossip when they see them.

12
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,250
Not good for your fertility

13
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:27,850
I'm also afraid that others will say that I got to the position through improper relationships.

14
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:30,810
Just put your hands on others and let them do whatever they say

15
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:32,810
But if you want to move, you can do whatever you want.

16
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:35,220
When you're tired, rest and don't push yourself

17
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,620
Got it boss

18
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:37,820
Then I will go to the company to be busy first.

19
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:39,820
Don’t miss it if you pass by

20
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:42,420
Peerless wild fruits from the pristine mountains

21
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:46,420
The guy with the best natural pollution taste in the world

22
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:47,620
What are you selling?

23
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,620
Apple is not like Apple

24
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,820
Peaches don’t look like peaches

25
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:52,020
Could it be a fake made with pigment?

26
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,620
Dear uncles, aunts, brothers and sisters
